11
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:30,076
The quoted bill: thirty-six thousand five
hundred pesos.

12
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:34,291
The unexpected personal share: eight
thousand three hundred.

13
00:00:34,395 --> 00:00:35,565
Coverage existed.

14
00:00:35,669 --> 00:00:36,840
Clarity was missing.

15
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:40,992
A later review brought the balance down to
one thousand three hundred.

16
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:45,994
Why did understanding the bill take extra
help?

17
00:00:46,114 --> 00:00:49,006
That question became the reason to build
MedCore.

18
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:54,120
MedCore brings hospital charges,

19
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,764
eligible benefits,

20
00:00:55,884 --> 00:00:59,545
