explainable ledger.

21
00:00:59,665 --> 00:01:04,278
A financial coordination layer alongside
existing hospital systems.

22
00:01:04,398 --> 00:01:04,920
Guide.

23
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:05,986
Verify.

24
00:01:06,106 --> 00:01:06,814
Reward.

25
00:01:06,934 --> 00:01:07,653
Report.

26
00:01:07,773 --> 00:01:08,508
Improve.

27
00:01:08,628 --> 00:01:10,645
One clearer picture for staff,

28
00:01:10,765 --> 00:01:12,333
