remaining balance,

39
00:01:52,145 --> 00:01:53,401
an itemized bill,

40
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:55,610
and the benefits already recorded.

41
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,512
Cora offers English,

42
00:02:03,632 --> 00:02:04,420
Taglish,

43
00:02:04,540 --> 00:02:05,242
Tagalog,

44
00:02:05,362 --> 00:02:07,598
and Ilokano language options.

45
00:02:07,718 --> 00:02:11,201
The important question stays simple: what
do I owe,

46
00:02:11,321 --> 00:02:12,050
